        "text": "进站前已有局部表面损伤是较大块状响应的另一待排查解释，与接触扰动经同一局部对比改变机理产生相同可观测预期。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:signature:1",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "细长响应以面积下限加任一拉伸条件界定，两种拉伸量为替代分支，复用同一假设与机理。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:condition:1:0",
        "origin": "declared_demo_heuristic",
        "text": "细长响应分支要求面积占比≥0.01（演示启发式阈值）。",
        "parameter_origin": "declared_demo_heuristic",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:condition:1:1",
        "origin": "declared_demo_heuristic",
        "text": "细长响应的拉伸条件可由轴对齐包围框长短比≥2.0或主轴离心率≥0.90任一满足，二者为替代分支。",
        "parameter_origin": "declared_demo_heuristic",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:cause:1:0",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "细长分支只提示方向性表面扰动，不能靠掩膜形态判定先后。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:cause:1:1",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "细长分支同样兼容方向性成像对比变化，与方向性表面扰动不可由形态区分。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:signature:2",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "结构缺口是并列待测检查之一，当前观测接口没有经核验的结构缺口或材料有无。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:cause:2:0",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "可见外轮廓缺口需用同型正常件匹配位姿、多视角背光复拍检验同一位置是否持续缺失；仅有局部响应或图像质心不能成立此项。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:signature:3",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "表面或光路对比变化是并列待测检查之一，当前接口没有表面沉积或工序时点观测。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:cause:3:0",
        "origin": "source_explicit",
        "text": "表面或光路对比变化需改光或视角复查轮廓稳定性与内部反差，并对照表面清洁与进站前后图像；完整外轮廓也不能排除内部裂纹。",
        "parameter_origin": "source_explicit",
        "source_id": "demo_mvtec_bottle_graded_rca_20261111",
        "source_unit_id": "su_16c0a92315b80d96",
        "locator": "{\"char_end\": 1929, \"char_start\": 0, \"end_line\": 27, \"start_line\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}"
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "source:mvtec-graded-human-review:or-repair",
        "origin": "declared_demo_heuristic",
        "text": "人工补回源资料的主轴拉伸替代支：离心率 ≥ 0.90，与长短比 ≥ 2.0 取 OR，任何一支都与同 ROI 面积 ≥ 0.01 联合。原编译稿只执行长短比分支。",
        "parameter_origin": "declared_demo_heuristic",
